{
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": "fufu_claim",
      "type": "boss_victory",
      "npc": "fufu",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 100,
      "conditions": {
        "has_unit": "warrior"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "fufu",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Ох, ребятки... Фух... Вы сильны...",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "witch",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Значит, ты признаёшь поражение и теперь принадлежишь мне?",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "fufu",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "*Вздох*",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "fufu",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Да, получается, что так...",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "witch",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Отлично! Воин, мни её сиськи!",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "warrior",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Отлично... Что?",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "fufu",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Что?",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "witch",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Что?..",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "warrior",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Разве ты не собиралась её победить и... И что?",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "witch",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Я же говорила, мне нужно собрать наблюдения...",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "warrior",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Тогда почему я должен мять её сиськи?",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "witch",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "А вдруг она растворит мои руки?",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "warrior",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "А вдруг мои?",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "witch",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Ну, тебе то не нужно делать записи... И без рук проживёшь...",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "fufu",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Хи-хи~",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "fufu",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Я могу не растворять, если захочу.",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "witch",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Правда?! Тогда мне срочно нужно тебя потрогать.",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "witch",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Раздевайся.",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "fufu",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Хорошо~",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "witch",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Ты тоже.",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "warrior",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Я?!",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "witch",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Конечно. Она ведь и тебя задирала. Не хочешь отомстить?",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "warrior",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Ну...",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "witch",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Не переживай, про тебя записывать не стану.",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "fufu",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Ну-ну, не нужно пугать этого мальчика... Он, наверное, и женщину никогда не трогал...",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "warrior",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Ах ты... Ведьмочка, доставай блокнот.",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "witch",
          "speaker_name": "",
          "emotion": "",
          "text": "Чувствую, дипломная работа будет на славу.",
          "characters": [{"id": "witch"}, {"id": "fufu"}, {"id": "warrior"}]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
